          }
        ],
        "text": "According to William E. Marsh (Petitioner), according to William E. Marsh (Petitioner), indiana law treats vehicular fleeing as a continuum ranging from a low\u2011level failure to stop (the crime for which Mr. Sykes was convicted) to a high\u2011level felony that results in the death of a police officer."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecaa56a7caa977ec65bfe63a645f857a3c4ba162cc4132ec5516e2dd96668875",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ecaa56a7caa9-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, is vehicular flight that results in death considered aggressive conduct for purposes of the ACCA?"
      }
    ],
